{"id":2724,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p><strong></strong></p><p>为庆祝中北大学建校85周年，塑造勤学善思、笃信笃行的良好风尚，强化青年学子的理论素养与思想觉悟，5月13日下午，马克思主义学院联合经济与管理学院在科艺苑学术报告厅举办华彩讲坛。本次讲坛由山西省委党校科学社会主义教研部副主任、教授、中国社会科学院博士王海燕老师主讲，马克思主义学院和经济管理学院部分研究生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8CgPolWkUmCbML8nkLl-ZnRvPUllMinzfVLl7aMz-snRN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiUYyYUYhfMNnVUm-4nmW2U8n7Uz9aLzliL7QVozLsnRAFo7L8oRTRUzMFMm98UYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbM4lJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6975&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/95C2CA6DEB23F2FCDDA801550FE937D8/8C489CA3/684C\" vheight=\" 315.363px\" vwidth=\" 420px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8CgPolWkUmCbML8nkLl-ZnRvPUllMinzfVLl7aMz-snRN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiUYyYUYhfMNnVUm-4nmW2U8n7Uz9aLzliL7QVozLsnRAFo7L8oRTRUzMFMm98UYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbM4lJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6975&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>王老师立足马克思主义经典理论，阐释现代化共性特征，梳理近代中国受西方冲击、逐步思想觉醒的历史脉络。从世情、国情、党情剖析百年变局时代背景，结合综合国力、文化传播及意识形态建设实例，解读新思想的创立背景、科学体系与理论价值，帮助同学们明晰其理论逻辑与实践伟力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HnmMg7L4T7nRv8MLzCiL7UZLlU8LzMM7nR7PnR-4MmLYL4l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDMkyYUYyDLR-4LNLaozCaM7W7nR-ZnzL8nzMfL7rRMRnFMlnkMRT2MRfFolCPUYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbM4lJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6975&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2642C60232C09604BDD28E34E3A0EC44/5DB49F40/9F1C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 458px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HnmMg7L4T7nRv8MLzCiL7UZLlU8LzMM7nR7PnR-4MmLYL4l0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDMkyYUYyDLR-4LNLaozCaM7W7nR-ZnzL8nzMfL7rRMRnFMlnkMRT2MRfFolCPUYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbM4lJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6975&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次讲坛搭建了理论学习交流的优质平台，进一步深化了青年研究生对党的创新理论的理解把握，为学校八十五载砥砺征程注入了鲜明的理论色彩与青春活力。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=HU8CgPolWkUmCbML8nkLl-ZnRvPUllMinzfVLl7aMz-snRN0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiUYyYUYhfMNnVUm-4nmW2U8n7Uz9aLzliL7QVozLsnRAFo7L8oRTRUzMFMm98UYb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CbM4lJqdonx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6975&e=.jpeg"}